- [mastra api trace query CLI reference](https://mastra.ai/reference/cli/mastra#mastra-api-trace-query)
- [Observability on Mastra platform](https://mastra.ai/docs/mastra-platform/observability)
- [Mastra platform regions](https://mastra.ai/docs/mastra-platform/regions)
- [Aggregate traces reference](https://mastra.ai/reference/observability/tracing/advanced-queries#aggregate-traces)
